{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:41:57.991Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"41f4eccd4616be2724f0676819e29b08b00f5a69db92fba0a8012983bdec1925","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until the handoff. Moss's 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest says the reassignment was effective 2026-05-04. So the date is May 4, 2026.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. One wrinkle: the 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management of Vantorre Mobility today\", but digests from 2025 already call it Gideon's fleet account. I'd confirm that before putting a start date on the slide. The current owner is Gideon either way.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30/26 digest calls it \"Gideon's medical account\". The 3/10/25 digest called it Nadia's, so it moved to Gideon at some point later. The digests don't give a date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's\" outdoor or retail account. The latest one (9/30) only says Nadia volunteered to run a gate-clerk training for them. That doesn't tell us who owns the account. Please check the CRM or ask Nadia or Gideon."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:42:02.230Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"dd91787017858d584b755c623f0bf29f4f6d2934130269026fcea27e83868100","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I posted the answer in #strategic-pod. Here it is:\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It changed hands on **May 4, 2026**, from Nadia Fennimore. Moss's 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment was effective that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, but 2025 digests already call it Gideon's fleet account. I'd confirm that before putting a start date on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, per the 9/30/26 digest (\"Gideon's medical account\"). A 3/10/25 digest called it Nadia's, and no digest gives the date it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's\" account, so please check the CRM or ask Nadia or Gideon."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
